\chapter{Engineering Hardware Implementation Architecture}
\label{chap:cle_engineering}

\section{Overview}
This chapter defines the complete engineering implementation architecture for the Cosmic Latte 
Engine (CLE) hardware ecosystem. The system integrates heterogeneous compute fabrics, 
high-bandwidth sensor networks, cryogenic thermal management, and zero-trust security boundaries 
into a unified physical computing platform.

All specifications, schematics, and integration pipelines are architected exclusively by 
C.~Matthew~Blackwell, Independent Designer.

\section{System Architecture Overview}
